#. translators: Name of a design field type, a numeric value, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:434
msgid "Number"
msgstr "Zahl"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, a picked colour, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:439
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "Farbe"

#. translators: Name of a design field type, an uploaded image, shown to the shopper in the cart line details.
#: src/Labels.php:444
msgid "Image"
msgstr "Bild"

#. translators: Heading of the status of an order line on the admin order screen.
#: src/Labels.php:449
msgctxt "heading: status of an order line"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#. translators: Heading of the shipment tracking links in the order details and shipping emails, shown to the shopper.
#: src/Labels.php:454
msgid "Tracking"
msgstr "Sendungsverfolgung"

#: src/Labels.php:458
msgid "Part of your order is on its way. The rest follows as soon as it ships."
msgstr ""
"Ein Teil Ihrer Bestellung ist unterwegs. Der Rest folgt, sobald er versandt "
"wird."

#: src/Labels.php:462
msgid ""
"There is new tracking for your order. Follow your parcel with the details "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Für Ihre Bestellung gibt es eine neue Sendungsverfolgung. Verfolgen Sie Ihr "
"Paket mit den Angaben unten."

#. translators: Accessible name of the tabs that switch between a product's sides, such as front and back, on the product page, read by screen readers.
#. translators: Heading of a group of fields in the Pixonaut tab of the product edit page, shown to the merchant: the product's sides, such as front and back, each with its template.
#: src/Labels.php:467 templates/admin/product-fields.php:153
msgid "Sides"
msgstr "Seiten"

#: src/Labels.php:471
msgid ""
"Your order is paid. Before we print it, please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it. Nothing is printed until you do."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Bestellung ist bezahlt. Bevor wir drucken, prüfen Sie bitte den "
"Korrekturabzug Ihres Designs und geben Sie ihn frei. Erst danach wird "
"gedruckt."

#. translators: Link in the proof email to the shopper, and under the order item on the order received page and in My Account; opens the proof page where the design is approved.
#: src/Labels.php:476
msgid "Review and approve your design"
msgstr "Design prüfen und freigeben"

#: src/Labels.php:480
msgid "Thank you for approving your design. It is now on its way to print."
msgstr ""
"Danke, dass Sie Ihr Design freigegeben haben. Es geht jetzt in den Druck."

#: src/Labels.php:484
msgid ""
"We are still waiting for your approval. Please check the proof of your "
"design and approve it, or tell us what to change. Nothing is printed until "
"you do."
msgstr ""
"Wir warten noch auf Ihre Freigabe. Bitte prüfen Sie den Korrekturabzug Ihres "
"Designs und geben Sie ihn frei oder sagen Sie uns, was wir ändern sollen. "
"Erst danach wird gedruckt."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:489
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will print your design as the proof "
"shows it."
msgstr ""
"Wenn wir bis zum %s nichts von Ihnen hören, drucken wir Ihr Design so, wie "
"der Korrekturabzug es zeigt."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:494
#, php-format
msgid "If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item."
msgstr ""
"Wenn wir bis zum %s nichts von Ihnen hören, stornieren wir diese Position."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:499
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will cancel this item and refund it."
msgstr ""
"Wenn wir bis zum %s nichts von Ihnen hören, stornieren wir diese Position "
"und erstatten sie."

#. translators: %s: date of the approval deadline.
#: src/Labels.php:504
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If we have not heard from you by %s, we will not print your design and will "
"be in touch about this item."
msgstr ""
"Wenn wir bis zum %s nichts von Ihnen hören, drucken wir Ihr Design nicht und "
"melden uns wegen dieser Position bei Ihnen."

#: src/Labels.php:508
